              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, mimi nikasema, “Ole wangu! Mimi nimeangamia, maana, midomo yangu ni najisi, na watu ninaoishi nao ni najisi kama mimi. Hata hivyo, kwa macho yangu mwenyewe, nimemwona Mfalme, Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
